                                    <span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_lblTitle"><font face="Tahoma" color="Navy" size="2">Title:</font></span>
                                </td>
				<td>
                                    <span id="ctl00_ContentPlaceHolder1_lblTitle2"><font face="Tahoma" color="Black" size="2">A resolution appropriating $10,000,000 in American Rescue Plan Act funds from Fund #30216 to the Housing Division of the Metropolitan Planning Department to increase homeownership opportunities and housing security for populations with historical barriers and demonstrated inequities in homeownership.</font></span>
                                </td>
			</tr>
		</table>
		
